/T (The findings suggest that LLMs, when fine-tuned, deliver state-of-the-art performance in financial sentiment tasks. Additionally, their outputs offer real utility in financial time series forecasting. Future work may extend to real-time trading signal generation, multi-lingual datasets, and integration with hybrid models such as reinforcement learning or RAG-enhanced systems.)
/E (The findings suggest that LLMs, when fine-tuned, deliver state-of-the-art performance in financial sentiment tasks. Additionally, their outputs offer real utility in financial time series forecasting. Future work may extend to real-time trading signal generation, multi-lingual datasets, and integration with hybrid models such as reinforcement learning or RAG-enhanced systems.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
